<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset OTP</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .main {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border-spacing: 0;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #1a73e8;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .body-content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .otp-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .otp-number {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            color: #1a73e8;
            background-color: #f1f3f4;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px dashed #1a73e8;
        }
        .warning {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #d93025;
            background-color: #fce8e6;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            background-color: #fdfdfd;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <table class="main">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <h2>Password Reset</h2>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="body-content">
                    <p>Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
                    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your account. Please use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to proceed:</p>
                    
                    <div class="otp-container">
                        <div class="otp-number"><%= otp %></div>
                    </div>

                    <p>This code is valid for <strong>10 minutes</strong>. For security reasons, do not share this code with anyone.</p>
                    
                    <div class="warning">
                        <strong>Security Note:</strong> If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or secure your account immediately.
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p>Sent by Your Company Name, 123 Street, City, Country</p>
                    <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Your Brand. All rights reserved.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
</body>
</html>